  "label": "dog as innocent individual who committed a minor offense",
  "description": "The visual entity 'dog' is mapped onto the textual entity 'me' (implied by the text 'what do you mean I've got a 30-day ban all i did was call him nigger'), creating an analogical mapping where the dog represents an innocent or unaware individual who is being punished for using a racial slur. This mapping is central to the meme's false equivalence, suggesting the offense is trivial.",
